   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "text": "Et franchement, ça se voit.",
   "accent_words": [
    "ça se voit"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "text": "Ici, personne ne sort sans son ring light.",
   "accent_words": [
    "ring light"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "text": "Le rond-point ? Un studio photo.",
   "accent_words": [
    "studio photo"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "text": "Les voitures tournent depuis mardi. Personne ne veut sortir du cadre.",
   "accent_words": [
    "cadre"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n6",
   "text": "À la boulangerie, la baguette est à deux euros.",
   "accent_words": [
    "deux euros"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n7",
   "text": "Le filtre beauté, lui, est offert.",
   "accent_words": [
    "offert"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n8",
   "text": "À la mairie, le maire répond à toutes les questions.",
   "accent_words": [
    "toutes"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n9",
   "text": "Le chômage ?",
   "accent_words": [
    "chômage"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n10",
   "text": "Les loyers ?",
   "accent_words": [
    "loyers"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n11",
   "text": "Et le panneau des réponses concrètes ? Toujours en chargement.",
   "accent_words": [
    "chargement"
   ],
   "claim_type": "fiction_satirique"
  },
  {
   "id": "n12",
   "text": "Mais derrière la mairie, il n'y a rien. Juste douze arrière-plans.",
